    <!-- 0.1.41 (LC): Navi aufs Kombi, Seitenblick beim Blinken -->
    <string name="verstanden">Understood</string>
    <string name="kombi_einstellung">Navigation in the instrument cluster (button on the map)</string>
    <string name="kombi_knopf">Map to cluster</string>
    <string name="kombi_normal">Cluster back to normal</string>
    <string name="kombi_info">The button appears next to the map. It shows your navigation app in the instrument cluster in front of you. It starts only while parked, and only for an app you have tested and released once in Panoptes (Display → Instrument cluster). Tap it again to return to the normal instrument display.</string>
    <string name="kombi_geht_nicht">This car cannot show other pictures in the instrument cluster (on the Dolphin Surf the cluster is a separate small system without a surface for this). The button therefore stays off.</string>
    <string name="kombi_freigeben">First test this app once in Panoptes while parked and release it (Display → Instrument cluster). Only then may the launcher put it in the cluster.</string>
    <string name="kombi_nur_stand">Only while parked. A navigation already shown keeps running while driving.</string>
    <string name="kombi_laeuft">Navigation is now in the instrument cluster.</string>
    <string name="kombi_zurueck">Instrument cluster back to normal.</string>
    <string name="seitenblick_titel">Side view when indicating</string>
    <string name="seitenblick_regel">While you indicate left or right, the screen shows the camera image of that side (with the rear view). It disappears by itself shortly after the indicator stops. It also appears while driving, because it is a driving aid; it needs no touch and makes no sound. With hazard lights nothing is shown. In reverse the car’s own reversing camera always has priority. Panoptes only reads the indicator, it never operates it. It does not replace looking over your shoulder.</string>
    <string name="seitenblick_blinker_fehlt">On this car Panoptes cannot read the indicator right now, so the picture cannot appear.</string>
    <string name="seitenblick_ist">Currently:</string>
    <string name="seitenblick_an">Switch on</string>
    <string name="seitenblick_aus">Switch off</string>
