    <string name="taste_zurueck">Back</string>
    <string name="taste_letzte">Last app</string>
    <string name="taste_fehlt">“Back” and “Last app” need Panoptes or the accessibility service “Panoptes Launcher”.</string>
    <string name="taste_fehler">That did not work.</string>
    <string name="hilfe_name">Panoptes Launcher: Back and Last app</string>
    <string name="hilfe_beschreibung">Lets Panoptes Launcher press “Back” and switch to the last used app. For this it only remembers the names of recently opened apps, in memory only, and reads no screen content.</string>
    <string name="hilfe_einstellung">Accessibility for “Back” and “Last app”</string>
    <string name="hilfe_erklaerung">For “Back” and “Last app” to work reliably in every app, switch on “Panoptes Launcher” yourself in the Android settings under Accessibility. Android now opens that page.</string>
    <string name="gross_titel">Large controls</string>
    <string name="gross_hinweis">Text, buttons, dock and bar are a quarter larger, labels have more contrast. Tiles keep their size.</string>
    <string name="einr_titel">Set up as home screen</string>
    <string name="kachel_weitere">More tiles …</string>
    <string name="einr_angebot_spaeter">Later</string>
    <string name="einr_angebot_ja">Set up</string>
    <string name="einr_angebot_text">The Home key then leads to Panoptes Launcher. “Everything back to BYD” undoes it at any time. Later you find this at the top of Settings.</string>
    <string name="einr_angebot_titel">Set up as home screen?</string>
    <string name="einr_s1_titel">1. Panoptes Launcher as home screen</string>
    <string name="einr_s1_text">The Home key then leads to Panoptes Launcher instead of the BYD home screen. “Everything back to BYD” undoes it at any time.</string>
    <string name="einr_einschalten">Switch on</string>
    <string name="einr_weiter">Next</string>
    <string name="einr_s2_titel">2. Test the Home key</string>
    <string name="einr_s2_text">Now press the car’s Home key. If Panoptes Launcher appears, this step is done. Otherwise tap “Did not work”.</string>
    <string name="einr_ging_nicht">Did not work</string>
    <string name="einr_s3_titel">3. Test Back</string>
    <string name="einr_s3_text">Tap “Test”. Panoptes opens a test page and presses “Back” there. If the page closes by itself, it works.</string>
